		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Animated, human-height trash heap.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +1 (1d6 + tetanus), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Golem</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Tetanus</strong>. CON 12+ or jaw spasms shut, cannot speak (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success.</p><p></p><p><strong>Trash</strong>. If copious trash is within close, can regain 1d6 HP as an action.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
